WEBVTT

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.089
<i>What up!</i>

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:10.926
<i>We are just moments away from</i>
<i>Professor Marmalade's Gala for Goodness,</i>

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.136
<i>where the legendary Love Crater Meteorite</i>

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.722
<i>will be on display</i>
<i>for the first time ever.</i>

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:19.935
<i>But what everyone is really buzzing about</i>
<i>is the Bad Guys</i>

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:22.104
<i>whose heart-melting rescue video</i>

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:25.566
<i>has made them</i>
<i>an overnight viral sensation.</i>

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:29.403
All right, guys, this is the big one.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:31.863
The Golden Dolphin
is inside a titanium case

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:34.825
<i>controlled by a randomly generated</i>
<i>five-digit code...</i>

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:37.703
<i>A code kept safe and secure</i>
<i>inside a briefcase</i>

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:39.413
<i>handcuffed to the chief of police.</i>

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.331
<i>[Piranha] She's not messin' around.</i>

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.334
<i>[Wolf] The code is only accessible</i>
<i>with her authorized fingerprints.</i>

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:45.627
[Snake] Leave thatto me.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.338
<i>[Wolf] While Snake gets the code,</i>
<i>Shark will secure the fake Dolphin.</i>

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.673
<i>[Shark] I like the sound of that.</i>

00:00:49.757 --> 00:00:51.758
<i>[Wolf] Meanwhile, the rest of us</i>
<i>plant circuit jammers.</i>

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.219
[Tarantula] Allowing me
<i>to hack into the power grid.</i>

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:56.638
<i>[Wolf] At the end of the night,</i>
<i>we toast the professor...</i>

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.889
<i>Blah-blah-blah, yada yada...</i>

00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:00.559
<i>and when I say "Marmalade,"</i>
<i>the lights go out,</i>

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:03.061
<i>and we'll have exactly four seconds</i>
<i>to make our move.</i>

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.564
[Snake] The oldswitcheroo.

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:08.317
<i>[Wolf] Chief hands Marmalade</i>
<i>the fake Dolphin.</i>

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.526
<i>We get our pardon.</i>

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:11.445
<i>Applause, applause, exit stage right,</i>

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:13.739
<i>and by the time</i>
<i>they realize what happened...</i>

00:01:13.823 --> 00:01:15.532
<i>So long, suckers!</i>

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:18.702
<i>...we'll be drivin' off into the sunset,</i>
<i>legacy cemented.</i>

00:01:18.786 --> 00:01:19.953
- [all laugh]
- [Tarantula] Nice.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:23.123
Gotta hand it to ya, buddy.
You're a real artist.

00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:28.420
Well, Good Guys, this is it.

00:01:28.504 --> 00:01:29.588
Good luck out there.

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:33.592
Remember, all eyes will be
on you tonight, not me.

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:37.763
Friends, meet the Good Guys!

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:41.433
[guests cheering]

00:01:43.227 --> 00:01:45.103
Uh, this is different.

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:47.439
- Is this a prank?
- What's that sound?

00:01:47.523 --> 00:01:49.650
Like screamin', but not terrified.

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:52.444
All right, guys.
Let's, uh... Let's mingle.

00:01:52.528 --> 00:01:54.529
It's crime time, baby.

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:59.618
<i>♪ Fly me to the moon</i>
<i>And let me play among the stars ♪</i>

00:01:59.702 --> 00:02:00.744
There you go.

00:02:00.828 --> 00:02:06.333
<i>♪ Let me see what spring is like</i>
<i>On Jupiter and Mars ♪</i>

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:09.419
Okay, fake Dolphin,
fake Dolphin, fake Dolphin.

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:10.504
Bingo.

00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:12.589
Mr. Shark! Mr. Shark!

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:14.800
Is it true sharks can smell blood
a mile away?

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:16.802
What? No. That's freaky.

00:02:19.013 --> 00:02:20.847
[laughing]

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:24.476
Mr. Wolf! Mr. Wolf!

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:26.311
- Whoa!
- It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:27.479
Pleasure is all mine.

00:02:27.563 --> 00:02:30.774
I loved your video.
Can I get a picture for my kids?

00:02:30.858 --> 00:02:32.567
Hey, just a minute, guys. Let me...

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:34.319
I gotta... I'll be right back.

00:02:37.281 --> 00:02:40.992
Okay, Wolf, what are you up to?

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:45.122
With criminals like this,

00:02:45.206 --> 00:02:48.333
you gotta be crafty, subtle, invisible.

00:02:48.418 --> 00:02:51.670
And then,
the moment they let their guard down...

00:02:51.754 --> 00:02:53.672
- Whammo!
- [muffled shouting]

00:02:53.756 --> 00:02:55.006
You spring the trap!

00:02:55.091 --> 00:02:57.050
Always one step ahead.

00:02:57.552 --> 00:03:00.011
I think I've earned a tonic water.

00:03:00.096 --> 00:03:01.847
Put it in a fun glass, huh?

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.224
Oh! Nice.

00:03:04.308 --> 00:03:06.268
- [Snake choking]
- [gasps]

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:07.811
- Oh, no.
- [yelps]

00:03:07.895 --> 00:03:09.604
[stammering]

00:03:11.232 --> 00:03:13.358
[Wolf grunting]

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.278
- [chuckles]
- Hey.

00:03:16.904 --> 00:03:19.781
- That's right, be intimidated.
- [Snake groaning]

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:25.579
[both] No, no, no!

00:03:25.663 --> 00:03:30.208
<i>♪ Look at me ♪</i>

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:33.044
[guests murmuring]

00:03:33.129 --> 00:03:34.296
- What?
- Hmm?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.256
Mmm.

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:41.678
<i>♪ Tell me what you see ♪</i>

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:50.645
<i>♪ Am I good or bad? ♪</i>

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:58.653
<i>♪ Don't you judge so fast ♪</i>

00:03:58.738 --> 00:03:59.905
[guests cheering]

00:03:59.989 --> 00:04:01.364
<i>♪ Hey, hey, hey ♪</i>

00:04:01.449 --> 00:04:05.535
<i>♪ I know you think you know me</i>
<i>You made your own conclusion ♪</i>

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:09.831
<i>♪ You think that I look scary</i>
<i>Well, that's your own delusion ♪</i>

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:13.752
<i>♪ Listen when I tell you</i>
<i>There's more than meets the eye ♪</i>

00:04:13.836 --> 00:04:17.714
<i>♪ So take a closer look</i>
<i>To find a real good guy ♪</i>

00:04:19.175 --> 00:04:20.926
<i>♪ We're not the bad guys ♪</i>

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.177
[Diane] Mr. Wolf.

00:04:22.261 --> 00:04:24.137
Diane...
Yeah, what a surprise.

00:04:24.222 --> 00:04:27.599
You know, if I didn't know better,
I'd think that you were avoiding me.

00:04:27.683 --> 00:04:30.018
Avoiding you?
Why would I do that?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.437
Okay.

00:04:32.522 --> 00:04:36.066
But I have to say,
I'm a little disappointed.

00:04:37.026 --> 00:04:40.237
I was hoping
you were gonna ask me to dance.

00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:41.363
Oh.

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:43.073
<i>♪ Get up on the floor ♪</i>

00:04:43.157 --> 00:04:47.244
<i>♪ We're gonna be good tonight</i>
<i>Wanna get you feeling right ♪</i>

00:04:47.328 --> 00:04:51.373
<i>♪ We're gonna be good tonight</i>
<i>We're the good, good guys ♪</i>

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:55.377
<i>♪ We're gonna be good tonight</i>
<i>Wanna get you feeling right ♪</i>

00:04:55.461 --> 00:05:00.173
<i>♪ We're gonna be good tonight</i>
<i>We're the good, good guys ♪</i>

00:05:00.258 --> 00:05:01.383
<i>♪ Come on! ♪</i>

00:05:02.426 --> 00:05:03.677
- Whoo-ooh!
- I see.

00:05:03.761 --> 00:05:05.136
You lost the sheep's clothing.

00:05:05.221 --> 00:05:08.306
Yeah. Figured it was time
I got comfortable in my own fur.

00:05:08.391 --> 00:05:10.058
<i>♪ If you're feelin' good in here ♪</i>

00:05:10.142 --> 00:05:12.269
<i>♪ I said, if you're feelin' good in here ♪</i>

00:05:14.063 --> 00:05:15.230
<i>♪ Oh, yeah ♪</i>

00:05:15.314 --> 00:05:17.065
I think I like the new you.

00:05:17.149 --> 00:05:18.608
Well, that makes two of us.

00:05:19.193 --> 00:05:23.280
<i>♪ We're all here to have</i>
<i>A good, good time ♪</i>

00:05:23.364 --> 00:05:27.117
<i>♪ Let the rhythm move you</i>
<i>And open up your mind ♪</i>

00:05:27.201 --> 00:05:31.538
<i>♪ Next time you see me</i>
<i>In your neighborhood ♪</i>

00:05:31.622 --> 00:05:35.625
<i>♪ Don't you be thinkin' that</i>
<i>I'm up to no good ♪</i>

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:39.838
<i>♪ I just want you to give me a chance ♪</i>

00:05:39.922 --> 00:05:43.884
<i>♪ I know your body really wants</i>
<i>To dance... ♪</i>

00:05:45.803 --> 00:05:48.930
<i>Break out the umbrellas,</i>
<i>because it's raining money!</i>

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:51.349
<i>All because of...</i>
<i>I can't even believe I'm saying this...</i>

00:05:51.434 --> 00:05:53.768
<i>All because of the Bad Guys!</i>

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:58.231
<i>♪ I wanna get you feeling right</i>
<i>We're gonna be good tonight ♪</i>

00:05:58.316 --> 00:06:00.150
<i>♪ We're the good, good guys ♪</i>

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:02.485
<i>♪ We're gonna be good tonight ♪</i>

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:06.531
<i>♪ Wanna get you feeling right</i>
<i>We're gonna be good tonight ♪</i>

00:06:06.616 --> 00:06:09.242
<i>♪ We're the good, good guys ♪</i>

00:06:09.327 --> 00:06:11.703
So, how does it feel

00:06:11.787 --> 00:06:14.372
to have everyone not fear you
for a change?

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.085
[muffled cheering]

00:06:21.839 --> 00:06:24.466
It feels... good.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.759
Real good.

00:06:26.802 --> 00:06:28.094
Diane...

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:31.056
[Diane gasps]

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.016
It belongs to you.

00:06:38.189 --> 00:06:40.023
<i>♪ Go to it, two, three ♪</i>

00:06:40.107 --> 00:06:44.069
<i>♪ We're the good, good guys</i>
<i>We're gonna be good tonight ♪</i>

00:06:44.153 --> 00:06:48.281
<i>♪ Wanna get you feeling right</i>
<i>We're gonna be good tonight ♪</i>

00:06:48.366 --> 00:06:50.742
<i>♪ We're the good, good guys ♪</i>

00:06:50.826 --> 00:06:54.579
<i>♪ Oh, yeah ♪</i>

00:06:55.706 --> 00:06:58.500
[guests cheering, applauding]

00:07:01.379 --> 00:07:03.380
Thank you. Thank you, Mr. Wolf.

00:07:03.464 --> 00:07:06.508
As you know, the money raised tonight
will be delivered tomorrow

00:07:06.592 --> 00:07:10.679
to schools, hospitals
and other worthy causes across the city!

00:07:11.681 --> 00:07:13.014
[Wolf clears throat]

00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:16.559
I just wanna take a moment to recognize

00:07:16.644 --> 00:07:19.145
the one responsible for our new outlook.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:20.689
Our brilliant mentor...

00:07:22.024 --> 00:07:23.608
- Do it.
- Come on.

00:07:23.693 --> 00:07:26.361
The one and only, Professor...

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.533
- [Tarantula] Wolf! Do it.
- Professor...

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:35.036
Um...

00:07:37.164 --> 00:07:39.165
Professor Marmalade!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.750
[guests cheering]

00:07:41.919 --> 00:07:43.753
Chief, may I do the honors?

00:07:47.216 --> 00:07:48.425
That's not the plan.

00:07:48.509 --> 00:07:49.926
What is happening?

00:07:50.011 --> 00:07:51.511
He's gone rogue.

00:07:53.264 --> 00:07:54.347
A deal's a deal.

00:07:55.683 --> 00:07:57.434
By the power vested in me,

00:07:57.518 --> 00:08:01.563
it is a pleasure to
grant the Bad Guys a full par...

00:08:01.647 --> 00:08:03.898
[guests gasping, murmuring]

00:08:04.942 --> 00:08:05.900
That was weird.

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.610
The meteorite is gone!

00:08:07.695 --> 00:08:08.820
[guest] Somebody stole it!

00:08:11.866 --> 00:08:13.199
- [Chief grunts]
- Chief.

00:08:13.284 --> 00:08:14.451
Wolf.

00:08:14.535 --> 00:08:16.828
Come on,
you can't possibly think that we did this.

00:08:16.912 --> 00:08:18.830
<i>So long, suckers!</i>

00:08:20.207 --> 00:08:21.833
Run!

00:08:21.917 --> 00:08:23.043
Get them!

